# COMPONENT

## JobControlLab

### PACKAGE

org.sample.jobcontrol

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal job-control sample component.

### SPECIFICATION

This component exists so help paths resolve with the same model-driven direction as 05-job.

# SERVICE

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Item-facing command target used by the lab.

### OPERATION

#### createItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates a controllable job-backed execution example.

##### IN

Item control payload.

##### OUT

Job-backed command result.

# ENTITY

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal entity used by the job-control lab.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type  | multiplicity |
|-------+-------+--------------|
| id    | entityid| 1            |
| name  | name    | 1            |
| title | string  | 1            |

# COMMAND

## CreateItem

### DESCRIPTION

Command that creates a job-control demo item.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| name  | name   | 1            |
| title | string | 1            |

# OPERATION

## createItem

### TYPE
COMMAND

### EXECUTION
async

### IMPLEMENTATION
blocking-task

### INPUT
CreateItem

### OUTPUT
CreateItemResult
